            </note>
            <note corresp="#d43-f2" n="2" xml:id="d43-f2-content">
                <p>The Central Intelligence Agency had already determined that this ship was
                    inappropriate for the operation; see <ref target="#d41">Document 41</ref>.</p>
            </note>
